    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm working on a low-fat mayo prototype and i'm having issues with phase separation in the high-acid batch. can you explain the specific role of lecithin in stabilizing the oil-water interface here? specifically how it handles the low pH environment.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
