      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i'm also looking at the stability over long-term storage. sometimes we see these tiny micro-droplets that seem to actively \"break away\" from the bulk emulsion rather than just sitting there. is there a specific thermodynamic reason why the emulsifiers would fail to anchor them in such an aggressive-looking way?",
